WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.560
Hi I'm Florence Rose, I'm a makeup artist
and a model. If you want to find out how

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:11.670
to create the perfect red lip then keep on watching. To create the perfect red

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.990
lip, I'm first taking It Cosmetics lip
liner in shades It Girl which is a

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:21.630
perfect true red. I am lining the outline
of my lips starting with the top lip and

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.369
going on to the bottom. I blend this out
slightly as you don't want aharsh red

00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:30.779
line. I really like this product as it's
very creamy and makes it much easier to

00:00:30.779 --> 00:00:39.090
apply to the lip than other products which
can be quite dry. So once I've lined my

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:43.170
lips I'm now taking Fenty Beauty's
Stunna Lip Paint in shade Uncensored.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:47.969
This is a perfect true red as well and I
like to apply this with the brush that it

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:53.340
comes with as it's perfect to apply with.
It's very creamy and this is a great

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:57.660
product as it's very cool toned
and a proper true red which goes nicely

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:04.190
with my fair skin tone and with my pink
hair, for me especially with my dry skin.

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:25.180
For more videos like this subscribe to
GLAMOUR UK's YouTube channel.

